{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、\n初めて読んでくださった方、\nコメントしてくださった方\nありがとうございます*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1日エイプリルフールやったね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"忘れてたあぁああぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そいえば、またちゅーされたんよ。\nえっ、報告いらんて⁇\nでも連続ちゅーですぞー⁉"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさにもされて...(いっつもやけど)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんにもちゅっちゅっちゅっちゅされてしまって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うあああぁあぁぁ////////"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんで、ちゅーされたら\nみんなに「にやにやすんな」てツッコまれる笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てれるからしかたないじゃろーーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はすごい風でした。\nみなさん大丈夫でしたかーーーx(⁇‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかはずっと家におりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"外出てたら間違いなく飛ばされてただろう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごかったよ。\n家にいても風の音びゅんびゅんきこえてたから。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早く落ち着いたよい天気になればいいな。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"OFFの日だったので、ゆっくり休みました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近の私服じゃ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帽子が似てるの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オーバーオールめっちゃ楽‼\nインナーが総柄でめちゃくちゃかわいいけど、\nこの写真じゃ全く見えんっっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーんもうっまったくねっもうっ←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊＊＊\nSecondシングル「おいでシャンプー」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Firstと同じく個人pvが収録されます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊藤万理華×有元沙矢香、山本真希\n「デート前日の気持ち」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わくわく"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Firstと全く違った感じです^^\n楽しみにしててください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では質問回答いくで。はいやっ\n................."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"俺バンドくんでいるんですけど...\n好きなバンドとかありますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バンド‼かっちょいー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すきなバンドは...いっぱいいうと\nflumpool\nGalileoGalilei\nASIAN KUNF-FU GENERATION\n東京事変\nねごと\n相対性理論\n...\nです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前のゲリラティッシュ配りで\n「いつもコメントしてる○○です。」\nっていってティッシュもらったの覚えてるかな？\n顔見ればわかるかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふふー^^覚えたっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベビたんがテスト勉強のときに\n食べたりするお菓子とか、\n使う文房具ってなんですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リビングにナッツ置いてあるので\nリビングで勉強するときはばりばり食べとる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"使ってる文房具...\n消しゴムはMONO"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーけっこう筆箱開けたら\nカラフルで統一感があるかも‼\nちなみに筆箱はCHUMSの水色です♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからずっとおでこ出してくれませんか??ww"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おおーう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おでこ出す機会があれば出すよーxD"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりちゃん可愛すぎる...\nちょっとその可愛さズルくない？(笑)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うあああぁーーーー\nありがとうーーーーーーーー><"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どどどどうしよう><嬉しすぎます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"俺の前世見てくれませんか？ww"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...うん⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女子のファンでもうれしいですか？\nまたコメントします！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なーにもうっ‼\nそりゃそりゃ嬉しくないわけがないです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うんっまたコメントしてください"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンレターをまりかちゃんに\n書こうと思っているんだけど\nもらったらうれしい？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大事に読んでます＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでメキシコ行きたいの(^^)？\nテキーラとか飲みたいのカナ？ｗ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こらっお酒はハタチからでしょう‼\nメキシコ雑貨が好きだから行きたいっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私、島根県に住んでるんですよ。\nそれでどうしても乃木坂46やまりりんに会いたいんですよ\n島根県で握手会はやらないんですか⁉\nすごく来てほしいんです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こうやってBloGで繋がってるから\n私を知ってくれているのがわかって嬉しい＊\n島根‼行きたい‼というか会いたい‼\nいろんなところでイベントしたいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0022.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名前の一色って本名\nなんですけどなんて読むか\nわかります？？ｗ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっしき...⁇\n違うかな><⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てか、ベビたんはまりかって\n読んでほしかったんだね!\nどっちで呼ぼうか悩んじゃうな～\nもはや「ベビか」ってどう(笑)?"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えーベビかってだめよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0024.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう高校二年生なんだからっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0025.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一応←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかって呼びたいけど...。\n何か抵抗あるなぁ。\nまりっしゅで落ち着きます。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっしゅ。\nうん、なかなかよい響き"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0026.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぇ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"柿ピーにピーナッツは必要だと思いますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ピーナッツと一緒に食べるのがおいしいよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0027.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鉢巻系男子ってどう思う？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"熱血‼\n体育祭で鉢巻するけど...燃えるね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0028.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うおおおおぉぉおって。\n鉢巻にはぜひ「乃木坂46」で"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0029.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここまで:)\n................."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全握のリハ頑張りまりか‼\nうおおおおぉぉお"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0028.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/04/7178727/0030.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}